From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Diogo Casteluber Laass <4793368+iowaz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 01:04:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Evolver: Add scheduled keybox monitoring controls

Owner-requested opt-in keybox monitoring and recovery.
Intervals: 15/30/45 minutes and 1/4/12/24 hours.
Shared manual/background operations, configurable notifications and en-US/pt-BR.
Includes the reviewed follow-up fixes; source tree unchanged by consolidation.
